From a4059698b05615a8ecb3125e053aaaf2bacb138e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jens Wiklander <jens.wiklander@linaro.org>
Date: Wed, 29 Apr 2026 11:39:48 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 743/913] core: copy subkey_version in shdr_load_pub_key()

Prior to this patch shdr_load_pub_key() didn't copy the subkey version
when loading a subkey, effectively always reporting it as version 0 and
disabling rollback protection. Fix this by extracting the subkey version
when extracting the other field to enable the rollback protection.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git 8a5808e515cde32e97eae45a029e73b21da8c087 core: copy subkey_version in shdr_load_pub_key()]
Fixes: c34d0d917ff5 ("core: support loading TAs signed with a subkey")
Change-Id: I6c4639ec80e9cc43a1623932b7fe08815f6bd969
Signed-off-by: Jens Wiklander <jens.wiklander@linaro.org>
Reviewed-by: Jerome Forissier <jerome.forissier@arm.com>
(cherry picked from commit 43ed01d216a9586e7e7591dff1f7fbf80923f93f)
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/optee/optee_os/+/583193
Tested-by: Yann GAUTIER <yann.gautier@foss.st.com>
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Yann GAUTIER <yann.gautier@foss.st.com>
Domain-Review: Yann GAUTIER <yann.gautier@foss.st.com>
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Thomas BOURGOIN <thomas.bourgoin@foss.st.com>
---
 core/crypto/signed_hdr.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/core/crypto/signed_hdr.c b/core/crypto/signed_hdr.c
index c97211a39..01e8555ef 100644
--- a/core/crypto/signed_hdr.c
+++ b/core/crypto/signed_hdr.c
@@ -315,6 +315,7 @@ TEE_Result shdr_load_pub_key(const struct shdr *shdr, size_t offs,
 
 	key->max_depth = subkey->max_depth;
 	key->name_size = subkey->name_size;
+	key->version = subkey->subkey_version;
 	memcpy(key->uuid, subkey->uuid, sizeof(TEE_UUID));
 	if (ADD_OVERFLOW(key->name_size, offs + shdr->img_size, &end) ||
 	    end > ns_img_size) {
